## Effect Mechanism & Mathematics

> [!NOTE]
> **Effect Name**: **Periodic Diagonal Glass Shine Sweep** (*30s Glass Reflection Pass*).  
> **Keyframe Mathematics**:
> - Total Animation Cycle: **30 seconds** (`infinite` loop).
> - Active Sweep Duration: **1.5 seconds** (0% to 5% keyframe timeline).
> - Path: Enters from **Left Edge** (`-140%`), sweeps diagonally at 30°, and exits past the **Right Edge** (`220%`).
> - Wait Period: **28.5 seconds** (5.1% to 100% keyframe timeline, hidden & off-screen).
> - Boundary Clipping: `overflow: hidden !important` following the element's exact `border-radius`.
> - Performance: 100% GPU-accelerated with zero JS timers, state updates, or authentication interference.

